OL,3,GNEWSAShopworker 'shaken' after man with
OL,4,Agun robs filling station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA filling station employee has been
OL,7,Fleft shaken after being held at
OL,8,Fgunpoint by a masked man.
OL,10,FThe armed robbery happened at a bureau
OL,11,Fde change in the station in Middletown
OL,12,Fin County Armagh.
OL,14,FIt happened on the Monaghan Road on
OL,15,FSaturday at about 13:00 BST.
OL,17,FHe demanded money from an employee, who
OL,18,Fpolice say was not hurt.
